## 后端 Owner

| 职责 | Owner | 边界/复用规则 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| HTTP/RPC/event 入口 | {{backend-entry-owner}} | {{backend-entry-boundary}} |
| Domain/application service | {{backend-domain-owner}} | {{backend-domain-boundary}} |
| Repository/model/migration | {{backend-data-owner}} | {{backend-data-boundary}} |
| Queue/cache/worker | {{backend-async-owner}} | {{backend-async-boundary}} |
| Auth/permission/billing/error | {{backend-policy-owner}} | {{backend-policy-boundary}} |
| External client/adapter | {{backend-integration-owner}} | {{backend-integration-boundary}} |
| Logging/metrics/tracing | {{backend-observability-owner}} | {{backend-observability-boundary}} |
| 后端测试 | {{backend-test-owner}} | {{backend-test-boundary}} |

删除不存在的职责，不保留空 Owner。
